Thought: Let me verify the molecular formula of this structure to confirm it matches our mass spec data.
Action: get_formula_from_smiles
Action Input: {"smiles": "CN1CCCCC1"}

Thought: Let me verify the molecular formula of N-methylcycloheptylimine to confirm it matches our mass spec data.
Action: get_formula_from_smiles
